//VERKAEUFE.http
### Login-Test
POST https://localhost:3002/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login-Test
POST https://localhost:3002/logout

### Variables
@verkaufsid = 5
### GET Verkaeufe
GET https://localhost:3002/verkaeufe

/### POST Verkaeufe
POST https://localhost:3002/verkaeufe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "anwesenheitsid":  1,
  "produktid":  1,
  "menge":  1,
  "rabatt": 0
}


### GET Verkaeufer Member
GET https://localhost:3002/verkaeufe/{{verkaufsid}}

### PUT Veraeufe Member
PUT https://localhost:3002/verkaeufe/{{verkaufsid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "produktid":  1,
  "menge":  30,
  "rabatt": 0
}